    deprecated standards docs, and folds in indie-review Tier-3
    closures.
  * Theme stylesheet now reaches top-level dialogs. Switched
    `MainWindow::applyTheme` from `setStyleSheet(ss)` on the
    MainWindow instance to `qApp->setStyleSheet(ss)` — Qt's
    stylesheet engine only propagates through a widget's render
    subtree, not through QObject parent-child, so top-level
    QDialogs never inherited the theme. (ANTS-1128)
  * Auto-return focus to terminal when any dialog closes; pseudo-
    modal click-blocking on the parent restored via the qApp
    eventFilter and two pure-logic helpers in
    `src/dialogfocus.h`. Mouse/key/wheel events landing outside
    any visible dialog's tree are swallowed; refocus on Close is
    deferred via `singleShot(0)` so dialog teardown completes
    first. (ANTS-1050, ANTS-1051)
  * Per-version ROADMAP archive — closed minors rotate to
    `docs/roadmap/<MAJOR>.<MINOR>.md`. Viewer pulls archives in
    only on demand (History preset / non-empty search). Numeric
    sort defeats the 0.10 < 0.9 lexical trap. (ANTS-1125)
  * `XcbPositionTracker` renamed to `KWinPositionTracker` with
    KDE-presence guard + `QScopeGuard` temp-file cleanup;
    post-fork heap allocations in the flatpak-spawn argv build
    retired (`snprintf` into stack buffers, `const char *argv[12]`
    assembled in the child). (ANTS-1045, ANTS-1046)
  * Menubar dropdown flicker (ANTS-1058) and mystery flashing
    dialog (ANTS-1054) confirmed resolved by the user.
  * Deprecated top-level `STANDARDS.md` and `RULES.md` retired
