  * ANTS_TRACE_DIALOGS=1 env var installs a DialogShowTracer
    event filter on the QApplication. Logs every top-level
    QWidget/QDialog Show event with className, objectName,
    windowTitle, parent, and geometry to stderr. Diagnostic
    step (a) of ANTS-1054 — the user reported a small popup
    flashing periodically in the centre of the terminal;
    the trace attributes the next occurrence to either an
    Ants spawn site (logged) or a child process (silent
    trace). Zero cost when the env var is unset.
  * shellutils.h::shellQuote switched from a denylist regex to
    a whitelist regex. The denylist missed glob wildcards
    (* ?), redirection (< >), and bracket-expansion specials
    ([ ]); a path containing any of those reached the shell
    unquoted and underwent globbing. Whitelist closes the
    class. Affects every caller of shellQuote — claude-launch
    builders and ssh-argv construction. (ANTS-1047)
  * ClaudeIntegration::findClaudeChildPid(pid_t) extracted
    from the two near-identical /proc walks in
    pollClaudeProcess and ClaudeTabTracker::detectClaudeChild.
    Both call sites share one helper; detectClaudeChild also
    gains the /proc-scan fallback that previously only
    pollClaudeProcess had. (ANTS-1048)
  * Cppcheck returnByReference perf sweep across seven hot
    getters: Config::loadFailureBackupPath,
    ClaudeBgTaskTracker::transcriptPath,
    GhostLineEdit::ghostSuffix, TerminalGrid::windowTitle,
    TerminalWidget::shellTitle, TerminalWidget::imagePasteDir,
    PluginManager::pluginDir.
  * tests/features/shellutils_whitelist/ — feature test for
    the ANTS-1047 fix.
  * ROADMAP.md hygiene — flipped 28 [ANTS-1015..1042, 1047,
    1048] bullets from planned to done after verifying each
