    update-available label's linkActivated signal. Probes for
    AppImageUpdate (GUI) first, appimageupdatetool (CLI) second;
    reads $APPIMAGE to find the on-disk path; runs the updater
    detached via QProcess::startDetached. Falls back to
    QDesktopServices::openUrl only when neither tool is installed
