    roadmap item. New GlobalShortcutsPortal client class wraps the
    Freedesktop org.freedesktop.portal.GlobalShortcuts D-Bus
    handshake (CreateSession → session handle → BindShortcuts →
    Activated) behind a single Qt signal. MainWindow binds the
    toggle-quake id with config.quake_hotkey as the preferred
    trigger when the portal service is registered on the session
