ants-terminal (0.6.38-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Wayland-native Quake-mode, part 1 of 2. When layer-shell-qt6 is
    present at build time, Ants's drop-down mode now promotes its
    window to a zwlr_layer_surface_v1 at the top layer, anchored to
    the top edge of the active screen — the Wayland equivalent of
    the X11 _NET_WM_STATE_ABOVE + client-side move() the XCB path
    has always used. CMake uses find_package(LayerShellQt CONFIG
    QUIET); missing devel = Wayland Quake falls back to the Qt
    toplevel path, X11 Quake is unaffected.
