ants-terminal (0.6.37-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Phase 3 of the 0.7.0 threading refactor. Retire the
    ANTS_SINGLE_THREADED=1 kill-switch introduced in 0.6.34 and
    delete the legacy single-threaded read/parse code paths from
    TerminalWidget. Bake period (0.6.34 → 0.6.37) proved the worker
