ants-terminal (0.6.36-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Tenth periodic audit. Two actionable findings across ~110 raw —
    a 2% signal ratio consistent with the codebase's calibration
    anchor. Both fixed in a single pass.
  * Remove dead RuleQualityTracker::prune() function. Declared in
    auditrulequality.h:133, defined in .cpp:250, never called. The
    retention logic had already been inlined into save() (const-
    method) when save needed to filter records without mutating.
    Two copies of the same cutoff logic would drift; save() is now
    the single source of truth. Flagged by cppcheck.
  * Hoist pipeRun QRegularExpression to static const in
    confirmDangerousPaste(). Previously rebuilt on every paste;
    now compiled once per process. Safe because
    QRegularExpression::match is reentrant and const-safe since
    Qt 5.4. Flagged by clazy's use-static-qregularexpression
    check.

